# Dependencies of the metrics repo (Exp 0).
#
# This file lists WHAT is needed. It is not the pin — compile it first:
#
#     uv pip compile docker/requirements-metrics.in -o docker/requirements-metrics.txt
#
# and commit the generated .txt. The Dockerfile installs the .txt, never this file,
# so the image can never be built from unpinned versions.
#
# Why this lives in the umbrella and not in the metrics repo: metrics has no
# pyproject.toml, so there is nowhere upstream to put it yet. Moving it into the
# repo (as a pyproject, matching its two siblings) is the better fix and is open
# decision #2 in INTEGRATION_PLAN.md.
#
# Source: the imports across the repo, plus its README's install line.

torch
sae_lens          # also pulls transformer_lens, which config.py and the SAE loader use
datasets          # corpus slice for collect_statistics.py
safetensors       # SAE weight loading
numpy
matplotlib        # reporting/make_report_figures.py
plotly            # reporting/visualize.py — the interactive dashboards
huggingface_hub   # `hf download` for the ~700 MB/layer stat caches
